Before you will launch this program, you should read this instruction:

In other case you will have a problems with this app!

Before executing:
    Check on your device apps:
        - Python3 (3.9 or higher)
        - Git

    Make sure, that you have installed modules such as:
        - platform
        - getpass
        - datetime
        - time
        - socket

*--------------- GLOBAL INFORMATION ----------------*

Installed external libraries by default:
    - psutil 5.9.0


If everything is ok:
    Execute the system in ./system/conhost.py

If not:
    You can tell us about this on our GitHub.